Glifftop is an independent, unofficial client for Gliff.

It implements the Gliff wire protocol, as defined by Gliff
(https://github.com/omacom/gliff), Copyright (c) 2026 Kevin McConnell
and contributors, released under the MIT License. Where algorithms are
ported from Gliff (for example the AVC444 recombine shader math), the
credit belongs to them.

In particular, GliffKit's Shaders/Recombine.metal is a port of Gliff's
crates/gliff-vk/shaders/recombine.comp and common.glsl.
